  {
    "id": "0cd38e43-26c2-4b66-a198-9ca353af5d71",
    "type": "heading",
    "props": {
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left",
      "level": 3,
      "isToggleable": false
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Chapters within Sections",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "664878a4-e9b6-4519-aaaf-ff13ac27a9a5",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "props": {
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "To arrange and re-arrange chapters within ",
        "styles": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Sections",
        "styles": {
          "italic": true
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": ", click-drag its handle and place it in the desired location.",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "dbd6daca-dfe0-4b96-98e2-6c2a049bd750",
    "type": "image",
    "props": {
      "textAlignment": "left",
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "name": "image-28.png",
      "url": "assets/image-28.png",
      "caption": "",
      "showPreview": true
    },
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "c8a285f9-8ea8-4cf3-817e-5f6d41286c48",
    "type": "callout",
    "props": {
      "textAlignment": "left",
      "textColor": "default",
      "icon": "💬"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "NOTE: Re-arranging chapters within Sections will trigger a confirmation dialog at the bottom of the screen if it changes the overall manuscript order. If you're moving chapters within Sections or Subsections without altering the manuscript sequence, your changes are saved automatically.",
        "styles": {
          "italic": true
        }
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "fe0ef49c-3d8f-473b-8d53-694576f8b79a",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "props": {
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "0e313db6-4d55-4dde-b0d9-7ec68d1840c3",
    "type": "heading",
    "props": {
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left",
      "level": 3,
      "isToggleable": false
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Scenes within & across chapters",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "405a537c-e85a-4bd8-8f0d-6c795c798726",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "props": {
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Scenes may be re-ordered within a chapter by click-dragging the scene and dropping it before or after another scene within the chapter. Scenes may also be dragged between chapters. If a scene is dragged from one chapter to another, it will automatically be placed as the last scene in the chapter. After it has been dropped at the end of the chapter, it can be dragged again to be re-arranged within its new chapter.",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "b971b838-8782-4630-8b04-58ce19b2f8f6",
    "type": "callout",
    "props": {
      "textAlignment": "left",
      "textColor": "default",
      "icon": "💬"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "NOTE: clicking a scene without dragging it will navigate to the scene in the editor pane.",
        "styles": {
          "italic": true
        }
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "fc2ba231-dd99-4bfc-8949-9d8c5e8105a8",
    "type": "heading",
    "props": {
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left",
      "level": 3,
      "isToggleable": false
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Scenes across Sections",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "ee04483c-8b26-4f56-a387-733399db1d3d",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "props": {
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "On rare occasions, a scene may need to stand alone between ",
        "styles": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Sections",
        "styles": {
          "italic": true
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "—for example, when the penultimate scene of Chapter 5 marks the end of Act 1, and the next scene (also in Chapter 5) begins Act 2. You can create these ",
        "styles": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Orphaned Scenes",
        "styles": {
          "bold": true
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " by dragging a scene from the end of a chapter directly into the next ",
        "styles": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Section",
        "styles": {
          "italic": true
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": ". Orphaned scenes can only sit at the boundary between ",
        "styles": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Sections",
        "styles": {
          "italic": true
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": ". To place an orphaned scene anywhere else in the new ",
        "styles": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Section",
        "styles": {
          "italic": true
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": ", you must first ",
        "styles": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "assign it to a chapter",
        "styles": {
          "bold": true
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " inside that ",
        "styles": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Section",
        "styles": {
          "italic": true
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": ".",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
