  {
    "id": "7ec63235-eea8-447a-809a-77877e34afbe",
    "type": "heading",
    "props": {
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left",
      "level": 2,
      "isToggleable": false
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Changing Layouts",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "28b0b362-7a7a-4546-a89a-6f10be385540",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "props": {
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Multiple layouts for a story can co-exist at once. If you're struggling to decide which layout best expresses the shape of your story, try creating different layouts. Only one layout can be active at once.",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "7c14a07b-c585-4850-a22a-ca13806eb7d0",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "props": {
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "If you create separate layouts and create additional scenes and chapters using only one of those layouts, changing the active layout will move all of the new chapters and scenes to the Unassigned ",
        "styles": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Section",
        "styles": {
          "italic": true
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": " so that you can define where they are meant to be placed in the new structure.",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "873b2bbc-d95e-4282-b9fb-73f7b5d24573",
    "type": "callout",
    "props": {
      "textAlignment": "left",
      "textColor": "default",
      "icon": "💬"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "NOTE: if there are differences in manuscript chapter/scene order between layouts, those changes will reflect in the Manuscript domain of the side bar as you toggle between them — no need to worry about re-arranging chapters and scenes and hoping you don't regret re-arranging them.",
        "styles": {
          "italic": true
        }
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
